    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6085d8b1c01b524ef2af0bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏在了解历史后明白了。\n过去那些沙土的冠军赛马娘们，\n在巅峰期过后仍跑到燃烧殆尽为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab9dc357fea98cb223030cc796647a74eac2d6fb55919a59eaa0ab593177389",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
