    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fc9eebef7347dee640e5e7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而她还没达到那个领域。\n为了将自己对沙土的心意与骄傲传达给后辈，\n奇锐骏开始奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ab9a299ffb1fd16624c6c34cb44bc3e7d8d8be0290994ebb978eca5dab9db1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
