      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca8af02d3a0419a984f79257",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让醒目飞鹰等人发展起来的沙土界\n能延续到下个时代──\n必须先登上王位，并捍卫王位。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e40e807ece6d5a96c4316b6225424089cfebb3e1e1d0527e6e45e162d5e16d66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100417.json",
      "json_path": [
