    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b3757b1ee38548e6e9da9b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要在沙土做到这件事是很困难的。\n因此她决定要参加更多的比赛，\n以增进自己的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e49df0f124fee1c13ec9bc9ad5544d9899ebd5068afe452214fa1e5389eccd37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100418.json",
      "json_path": [
