    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c2e26cc3667d4c82a42eb99",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "营养均衡方面应该没有问题才对。\n训练员开始怀疑她是否过劳，\n并烦恼该不该继续照现在的步调训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fd515debcdc71cc91f40c13680609cb3eb267f4baca6211335f701ec8dd736c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
