      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "克服了试炼后，\n训练员和奇锐骏成为了真正的搭档。\n好歌剧在见证这个结果后离开了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "312ba1941a5740be1503b2bdb4e36119ee7872a7193868b54b4717bdc3287927",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
