      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏背负着众多心愿，干劲十足。\n现在的她对上醒目飞鹰\n或许也能跑出好成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "783ca32a51d1720b8ea8d42595cc7b9ed8e8ce6912fd6eac295caead72185731",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
