    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93e677005b72531914173c75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏虽精疲力尽却也跑出了好成绩。\n另一方面，\n醒目飞鹰带着笑容对观众们挥手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47a51f1e1b6b715b844d1efff2ceeb7e092449fae5f3635f89080ba05068149b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
