      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏没有顾虑观众的余力。\n话虽如此，却也感觉到自己看见了目标的背影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7996cd736cbb101ec8c0b138c9e78b24cbb3d2fb759bc64c54df422febd393e",
