    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7299f38220eef6800d065496",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了展现出自己足以跟对方并驾齐驱，\n她还想跟对方再跑一次。\n决定在悠闲度过新年后，参加“川崎纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ff8a512b6cbbac371fac1cde9da3d10f1074ce325e437c96cff391c042e25aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
