    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f84ba58b325969f2ab51f16d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，奇锐骏的梦想实现了。\n然而，这之后才是问题。\n过于勉强的训练后，不知道会造成什么影响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b06721aae3cce1bb76db9de1b3a2c4531a1b9538527a418673e3dec3c0de9b9",
