      "uid": "zhcn:502e8e68c77de35f4e8ad3c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她却想再次与醒目飞鹰奔跑。\n有机会能实现再战的比赛……\n“柏纪念”似乎是不错的选择。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff1b553b56beb9f7f35d2b611909bd4b9dcd3422f373cc8da7da54f301f0e7ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
