      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏顺利地跑完了全程。\n然而，她却在比赛后做了一个决定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c80d0d0f3aa2a079effcf1c8a8df423cd72e558c7d7b310526be36a80bd342b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
