      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──引退。已将希望带给想重新振作的人们，\n且已经提不起力气的现在正是时机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79aebd84468cb33b329b7d94f0783b007c0a3589faba82faf8288dcde4448b74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
