    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b963cbf69ae8aceb5b50f0c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "全力挑战“川崎纪念”后的疲劳是很严重，\n但就这样结束好吗──\n训练员向她提议再多坚持一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f7662f7d37994febff1c19fee8fef7fbc933f65b77e18cfe93abac9d2a6aaae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100424.json",
      "json_path": [
