      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏在“东京大赏典”拿下胜利。\n向北港火山展现前辈的威严，\n并温柔地笑着要她追上来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96e19fc9851ef890fcfb0e67ccdcc61f4978072e3bb692d0b493d73082f1b6a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
