    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:541b2dbe04f2fff06e558205",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "沙土这条路──长得漫无止境。\n奇锐骏却发誓只要她还活着，\n就会一直走下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60e35ad1fc0f2b4b0eec46adce5cec7df8159f7f4adba1e831937c6d466d4eb5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
